        "original_id": "4c6c957c-57ea-55d9-ad7d-c50888caeb67",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andrea Camplone\n- Organizations: Lega Serie B, Lega Calcio\n- Places: Italy\n- Roles: football coach, former player, head coach\n- Teams: Cesena\n- Competitions: Serie B\n- Topics: league structure, nicknames\n\nFacts:\n- Andrea Camplone was born on 27 July 1966.\n- Andrea Camplone is an Italian professional football coach and former player.\n- Andrea Camplone is the head coach of Cesena in Serie B.\n- Since July 2010, Lega Serie B has organized Serie B after the split of Lega Calcio.\n- Before July 2010, Lega Calcio organized both Serie A and Serie B.\n- Serie B is contested by 22 teams.\n- Serie B is commonly nicknamed \"campionato cadetto\" and \"cadetteria.\"\n- In Italian, \"cadetto\" means junior or cadet.",
